  "description": "The empress of a fallen nation was dragged to the enemy empire. Despite everything, the Treasure of Grandel was still gorgeous. However, in the end she was just a captive who was going to be hanged by the savages. Eliza wanted to avoid that outcome no matter what, even if she had to tell outrageous lies. There was only one option: the man known as Banella's guard dog, the enemy empire's commander, and a lowly and vicious warrior—Lezet Christian. Eliza had to convince this cold and obstinate man who stood before her.\n\nIn a trembling voice, she said, \"I'll give you a child.\"\n\nPromotional Webtoon/Novel\n\n***Artist's:**  \nPromo: 8garak  \nCover: Pilyeon*",
